{"3187960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "METACRAFT: Arena", "steam_appid": 3187960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/60fc6774a6f70edfff16c0fc58867dfe.poster.avif?t=1764757629\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/60fc6774a6f70edfff16c0fc58867dfe.webm?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/60fc6774a6f70edfff16c0fc58867dfe.mp4?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new approach to the genre of massively multiplayer games. We took the best of MMORPGs and reworked it for the modern player who values their time and engaging gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/df445d9a237244e15811b1e093a79da6.poster.avif?t=1764757629\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/df445d9a237244e15811b1e093a79da6.webm?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/df445d9a237244e15811b1e093a79da6.mp4?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and trade, get rich, upgrade your base, character, and gear — become the most successful player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/c0c2dd5cfa8d1cbf9d0eb682b861bba9.poster.avif?t=1764757629\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/c0c2dd5cfa8d1cbf9d0eb682b861bba9.webm?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/c0c2dd5cfa8d1cbf9d0eb682b861bba9.mp4?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head into hardcore PvE missions for valuable materials or assemble a well-coordinated PvP team to claim rewards from every tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/4e765c7d192979b35527092851cfa8fd.poster.avif?t=1764757629\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/4e765c7d192979b35527092851cfa8fd.webm?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/4e765c7d192979b35527092851cfa8fd.mp4?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst into large-scale clan wars, seize territories, earn a share of in-game commerce, and become the scourge of the entire server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/25e481156e706c68d3279e7bdf05408c.poster.avif?t=1764757629\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/25e481156e706c68d3279e7bdf05408c.webm?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/25e481156e706c68d3279e7bdf05408c.mp4?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METACRAFT: Arena offers a wide range of PvP and PvE activities that flexibly adapt to your playstyle. Show everyone who the true champion is!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/60fc6774a6f70edfff16c0fc58867dfe.poster.avif?t=1764757629\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/60fc6774a6f70edfff16c0fc58867dfe.webm?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/60fc6774a6f70edfff16c0fc58867dfe.mp4?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new approach to the genre of massively multiplayer games. We took the best of MMORPGs and reworked it for the modern player who values their time and engaging gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/df445d9a237244e15811b1e093a79da6.poster.avif?t=1764757629\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/df445d9a237244e15811b1e093a79da6.webm?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/df445d9a237244e15811b1e093a79da6.mp4?t=1764757629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and trade, get rich, upgrade your base, character, and gear — become the most successful player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 